WEBVTT

00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:30.216
(Fim do som de Beatbox)

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:32.580
Estão prontos?

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.631
(Aplausos)

00:00:33.655 --> 00:00:35.320
Estão prontos?

00:00:35.956 --> 00:00:37.356
Ed Cage: Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:00:37.607 --> 00:00:40.301
(Som de Beatbox)

00:00:43.357 --> 00:00:45.426
(Risos)

00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:48.414
Gostaram? Deixem-me mostrar-vos 
como fazíamos...

00:00:48.438 --> 00:00:49.963
NP: Dá-lhe pai, dá-lhe.

00:00:49.963 --> 00:00:52.480
EC: Quando eu era miúdo, nos anos 90.

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:54.641
(Som de Beatbox)

00:00:57.815 --> 00:00:59.815
(Fim do som de Beatbox)